2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":"Thank you for a fun and well spirited game "}],"spiritreceived":[{"game_id":80,"givenby":"Republic of Korea Mixed","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":81,"givenby":"Germany Mixed","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":12,"comments":null},{"game_id":78,"givenby":"Canada Mixed","cat1":2,"cat2":1,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":9,"comments":"For the 1 in body contact, took a few conversations to navigate but we appreciate appreciate the change for the second half in contact. Comments made after the games were not all previously discussed with spirit captains prior spirit circle, learning moment for next time. "},{"game_id":79,"givenby":"Panama Mixed","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":"Overall a few well spirited game"},{"game_id":139,"givenby":"Japan Mixed","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":142,"givenby":"Austria Mixed","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":136,"givenby":"United States of America Mixed","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":3,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":220,"givenby":"New Zealand Mixed","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":224,"givenby":"Chinese Taipei Mixed","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":"This was a really fun game. We felt the spirit all game was very high and all calls were resolved well. Thanks for a great game, GB!"},{"game_id":228,"givenby":"Colombia Mixed","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":"Great game to finish the tournament. Really good spirit, they communicated very politely always willing to listen and were very receptive. They were cheering for us when wee did something good. Men were a little physical on the body check which could improve :) \r\nOverall an excellent game! "}],"spirits